    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60842" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠνηγ-ετέω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνᾱγ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hunt</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1382
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				5.34
			</span></i>, etc.: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὗς ἀγρίους κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.255
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				31.14.3
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>persecute, harass</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				572
			</span></i> (lyr.); <i>hunt down</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινας</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				43
			</span></i>: c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τέκνων διωγμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					898
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): abs., <i>quest about</i>, like a
			hound, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				5
			</span></i>.</div>
